<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/fddbc9fe-3665-4be9-bc25-4e83e633bec6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/fddbc9fe-3665-4be9-bc25-4e83e633bec6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mmap the input file instead of file-read-all into the arena: measured on GO as fread+touch 6.8 ms vs mmap+touch 2.5 ms (about 1.5% of the 310 ms parse) with no RSS gain since file-backed pages count toward resident size; below the 10% adoption bar, and unsafe for the non-streaming parse whose Graph would outlive the mapping." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
