<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2512c82a-b606-4fea-9047-acb6b5157799> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Four-valued XsdCompareResult ordering for XSD literals" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2512c82a-b606-4fea-9047-acb6b5157799> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2512c82a-b606-4fea-9047-acb6b5157799> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "xsd.slop adds a value-space ORDERING capability alongside the existing xsd-values-equal equality check: a new XsdCompareResult enum (xsd-compare-less | xsd-compare-equal | xsd-compare-greater | xsd-compare-incomparable) plus xsd-values-compare (XsdValue x XsdValue -> XsdCompareResult) and xsd-compare (Arena x Term x Term -> XsdCompareResult, operating directly on RDF Term/Literal pairs). Numeric XsdValue variants (integer/decimal/float/double) are ordered pairwise by casting both operands to Float and delegating to the new float-cmp helper, extending the same cross-type `cast Float` promotion xsd-values-equal already uses for numeric value-space equality. xsd-compare defaults a literal's missing datatype to XSD_STRING, reuses the existing xsd-types-compatible check, and folds any xsd-parse-value error or type incompatibility down to xsd-compare-incomparable rather than propagating a Result/error — mirroring the existing permissive-fallback style already used by xsd-validate-lexical's Tier 3/4 handling. Evidence: commit c44a62fb \"udpates to support snarl\", src/xsd.slop new `(type XsdCompareResult (enum xsd-compare-less xsd-compare-equal xsd-compare-greater xsd-compare-incomparable))`, `(fn float-cmp ...)`, `(fn xsd-values-compare ...)`, `(fn xsd-compare ...)`, and the module export-list additions XsdCompareResult / xsd-values-compare / xsd-compare." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2512c82a-b606-4fea-9047-acb6b5157799> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2512c82a-b606-4fea-9047-acb6b5157799> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-11T19:37:39Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
