<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/2e773a00-4289-4015-b146-3c0ab5e9c031> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2ce01372-29f6-4032-a4df-646bafbafe9b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
