<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/439a4ddc-7cb6-480e-b225-76ce604f7362> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/439a4ddc-7cb6-480e-b225-76ce604f7362> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Single-lookup lazy nested-map init in indexed-graph-add" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/439a4ddc-7cb6-480e-b225-76ce604f7362> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/439a4ddc-7cb6-480e-b225-76ce604f7362> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "indexed-graph-add's SPO/PSO/OSP index-update blocks now populate each level of the nested Term->Term->TripleSet maps with a single `(match (map-get ...) ((some ...) ...) ((none) (let (...) ...)))`, constructing and `map-put`-ing a fresh predicate-map/subject-map and/or fresh TripleSet only inside the `(none)` arm, instead of the prior two-step pattern of `(when (not (map-has idx k)) (map-put idx k (map-new/set-new ...)))` followed by an unconditional `(match (map-get idx k) ...)` that was guaranteed to hit `(some ...)`. This collapses what was a map-has probe plus a conditional map-put plus an unconditional map-get into a single map-get per level, applied identically across all three index blocks (SPO: subject -> predicate-map -> TripleSet; PSO: predicate -> subject-map -> TripleSet; OSP: object -> subject-map -> TripleSet). Evidence: commit 04fa80469a7d373bb9dd4904bd0327ce8673c164, src/index.slop — each of the three `;; Update SPO/PSO/OSP index` blocks in indexed-graph-add drops its `(when (not (map-has ...)) (map-put ... (map-new/set-new ...)))` guard and restructures the subsequent `(match (map-get ...) ((some ...) ...) ((none) (do)))` into `(match (map-get ...) ((some ...) (match (map-get ...) ...)) ((none) (let ((fresh-map ...) (ts ...)) (set-put ts t) (map-put fresh-map ...) (map-put idx k fresh-map))))`." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/439a4ddc-7cb6-480e-b225-76ce604f7362> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/439a4ddc-7cb6-480e-b225-76ce604f7362> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-06T21:28:34Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
