<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c1f7797-9058-4bc5-bdff-97093ac9135e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c1f7797-9058-4bc5-bdff-97093ac9135e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Tiered permissive strategy for xsd-validate-lexical" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c1f7797-9058-4bc5-bdff-97093ac9135e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c1f7797-9058-4bc5-bdff-97093ac9135e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "xsd-validate-lexical only performs real lexical-form checks for Tier 1 core XSD types (string, integer, boolean, decimal, float, double) and Tier 2 integer subtypes (long/int/short/byte, their unsigned variants, and non-negative/positive/negative/non-positive integer), each delegating to the existing parse-int/parse-float parsers plus a literal range check for the bounded subtypes; rdf:langString is always accepted regardless of lexical form (its validity is gated by presence of a language tag, not the lexical form); and every other datatype IRI — unimplemented Tier 3/4 types (dates, times, durations, binary encodings, anyURI, Name/NCName/token variants, etc.) as well as any unrecognized IRI — falls through to an unconditional `true`. Evidence: commit 99eee67, src/xsd.slop new `(fn xsd-validate-lexical ...)`, its `cond` chain labeled \"Tier 1: core XSD types\" / \"Tier 2: integer subtypes\", the \"Skip langString — validated by lang tag presence, not lexical form\" comment, and the final `(else true)` arm under \"Tier 3/4 and unknown types: return true (spec-compliant)\"." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c1f7797-9058-4bc5-bdff-97093ac9135e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c1f7797-9058-4bc5-bdff-97093ac9135e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-08T17:16:35Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c1f7797-9058-4bc5-bdff-97093ac9135e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Tiered permissive strategy for xsd-validate-lexical" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c1f7797-9058-4bc5-bdff-97093ac9135e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7386f8a7-a4f0-4c99-868b-2432454f0161> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4c1f7797-9058-4bc5-bdff-97093ac9135e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/451e44b0-2d01-46df-ae76-cbf9d687b38a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52e7f143-3c47-4dfd-b7cb-4fce4e305c31> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52e7f143-3c47-4dfd-b7cb-4fce4e305c31> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Blank label map for `_:label` node identity" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52e7f143-3c47-4dfd-b7cb-4fce4e305c31> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52e7f143-3c47-4dfd-b7cb-4fce4e305c31> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "TtlParseContext.blank-labels is now a BlankLabelTable record — (arena Arena) (ids (Map String (Int 0 ..))) — instead of a (List BlankLabelBinding) searched linearly. The `_:label` branch of parse-blank-node-extended looks the label up through a zero-copy view of the input; only a new label is copied, by blank-labels-add, which is called with the table's own long-lived arena so map-put grows the map there even while the statement is parsed in a scratch arena. Semantics are unchanged: a repeated label reuses its id, a new label takes the next id from context-gen-blank-id at the same grammar point as before. The field keeps its name, so n3.slop needed no edits; BlankLabelBinding stays exported but unused." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52e7f143-3c47-4dfd-b7cb-4fce4e305c31> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52e7f143-3c47-4dfd-b7cb-4fce4e305c31> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/22018cfd-d2a0-4ea3-a8b2-e96da982bef7> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52e7f143-3c47-4dfd-b7cb-4fce4e305c31> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-30T04:14:05.370136Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52e7f143-3c47-4dfd-b7cb-4fce4e305c31> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Blank label map for `_:label` node identity" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52e7f143-3c47-4dfd-b7cb-4fce4e305c31> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isConstrainedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/0c3057dd-1f70-410b-b6ee-a7681e79671c> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
