<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/dc194798-e290-471f-8e76-65fc0dbcc83e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isConstrainedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/cc56ed06-7a6b-4ef4-8d5a-1feb56b986e5> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
