<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e1779018-34aa-4c27-aada-eca6b934e5ad> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e1779018-34aa-4c27-aada-eca6b934e5ad> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Scalar offset/line/column scanning for parser hot loops" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e1779018-34aa-4c27-aada-eca6b934e5ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e1779018-34aa-4c27-aada-eca6b934e5ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: skip-whitespace, skip-line, parse-while, and parse-until in src/parse/common.slop no longer call state-advance once per character (each prior call allocated a fresh ParseState via record-new); instead they track offset/line/column as local mutable scalars via char-at/string-len and build exactly one ParseState at the end through a new state-with-position helper. src/parse/ttl.slop's parse-pn-local-rest (prefixed-name local-part dot-continuation scan) and the single-quoted-string case of parse-ttl-string apply the same technique: a scalar pre-scan over raw offset, with a new fast path in the string case that substrings directly to the closing quote when no backslash/newline/quote appears first, falling back to the old per-char escape-aware loop only when an escape is actually present.\n\nWhy: this PR (#4 \"performance\", body \"parser performance improvements\") replaces one-ParseState-allocation-per-character-advanced with O(1) allocation per hot-loop call. Evidence: src/parse/common.slop diff — new `state-with-position` fn, and skip-whitespace/skip-line/parse-while/parse-until's while-loops changing from `(set! s (state-advance arena s))` to scalar `(set! offset (+ offset 1))`/line/column updates with a single `state-with-position` call after the loop; src/parse/ttl.slop's parse-pn-local-rest rewrite and parse-ttl-string's new fast-path pre-scan (`(while (and (not fast-done) (< scan len)) ...)`) ahead of the retained slow escape-handling loop." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e1779018-34aa-4c27-aada-eca6b934e5ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e1779018-34aa-4c27-aada-eca6b934e5ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-29T00:06:21Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e1779018-34aa-4c27-aada-eca6b934e5ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Scalar offset/line/column scanning for parser hot loops" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e1779018-34aa-4c27-aada-eca6b934e5ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/6393769e-e94e-4355-8c99-49ad932a82df> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e1779018-34aa-4c27-aada-eca6b934e5ad> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/7a8f606d-195e-44c6-a2ed-f4b21fb6bbf5> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e26657b0-87c4-4aff-b55e-a364971e2303> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e26657b0-87c4-4aff-b55e-a364971e2303> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Restore term-eq result postcondition" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e26657b0-87c4-4aff-b55e-a364971e2303> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e26657b0-87c4-4aff-b55e-a364971e2303> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "term-eq in src/rdf.slop regains its `(@post (== $result (== a b)))` runtime-checked postcondition, inserted directly after the existing `(@pure)` tag and before the `@example` lines. Evidence: src/rdf.slop diff hunk — `+ (@post (== $result (== a b)))` added under term-eq's `(@intent \"Check if two terms are equal\")` / `(@spec ((Term Term) -> Bool))` / `(@pure)`." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e26657b0-87c4-4aff-b55e-a364971e2303> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e26657b0-87c4-4aff-b55e-a364971e2303> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/452e3824-a019-4ba3-b0bc-6a3547efac1f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e26657b0-87c4-4aff-b55e-a364971e2303> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-17T19:28:51Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
