<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e26657b0-87c4-4aff-b55e-a364971e2303> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#supersedes> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b1de6788-5d5c-4867-b441-6328ef918b45> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e80d9049-791e-409d-bb2c-0ef5d098c13e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e80d9049-791e-409d-bb2c-0ef5d098c13e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Unchecked graph-add for TTL parser hot path" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e80d9049-791e-409d-bb2c-0ef5d098c13e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e80d9049-791e-409d-bb2c-0ef5d098c13e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "graph-add-unchecked, a new sibling to graph-add on the plain (non-indexed) Graph type, appends a triple via list-push without first calling graph-contains(g,t) for dedup, and asserts `(@post (== (graph-size $result) (+ (graph-size g) 1)))` — a strictly-incremented-size guarantee — instead of graph-add's dedup-preserving `(@post (graph-contains $result t))`. src/parse/ttl.slop's parse-triple call sites (the two `(set! g (graph-add arena g t))` calls appending extra-triples and predicate-object-list triples) now call graph-add-unchecked instead, because graph-add's graph-contains check is an O(n) linear scan over the plain Graph's triples list, run once per parsed triple, making straightforward TTL parsing scale O(n^2) with document size. Evidence: src/rdf.slop's new `(fn graph-add-unchecked ...)` under `(@intent \"Add a triple to the graph without duplicate checking\")`; src/parse/ttl.slop's two graph-add -> graph-add-unchecked import/call-site changes." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e80d9049-791e-409d-bb2c-0ef5d098c13e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e80d9049-791e-409d-bb2c-0ef5d098c13e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-07T03:15:11Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e80d9049-791e-409d-bb2c-0ef5d098c13e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Unchecked graph-add for TTL parser hot path" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e80d9049-791e-409d-bb2c-0ef5d098c13e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isConstrainedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/ae9db45d-d658-4721-9a5f-2cba7e892d1e> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e80d9049-791e-409d-bb2c-0ef5d098c13e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/58f5a3de-16bf-48b7-8414-79a85cae9d27> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/e80d9049-791e-409d-bb2c-0ef5d098c13e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/c8d9827e-552e-41e2-a5e3-0d7344c6f30b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0009977e-6326-4efc-861f-f85b3c3d9ae3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0009977e-6326-4efc-861f-f85b3c3d9ae3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "indexed-graph-match's and indexed-graph-for-each's predicate+object-bound branch drops from O(subjects of p) to O(1) index lookup plus O(matching subjects) iteration" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
