<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0009977e-6326-4efc-861f-f85b3c3d9ae3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-29T17:07:28Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0009977e-6326-4efc-861f-f85b3c3d9ae3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "indexed-graph-match's and indexed-graph-for-each's predicate+object-bound branch drops from O(subjects of p) to O(1) index lookup plus O(matching subjects) iteration" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0149e858-86f0-48e8-8cee-bd5d7889cdf3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0149e858-86f0-48e8-8cee-bd5d7889cdf3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "indexed-graph-for-each diverges from indexed-graph-match's linear scan" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0149e858-86f0-48e8-8cee-bd5d7889cdf3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0149e858-86f0-48e8-8cee-bd5d7889cdf3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "indexed-graph-for-each no longer shares its filtering strategy with indexed-graph-match: it now walks the SPO index when subject is bound, PSO when only predicate is bound, OSP when only object is bound, and falls back to iterating g.triples only when nothing is bound — mirroring the pre-allocation-avoidance dispatch structure that indexed-graph-match itself abandoned in an earlier commit, but for indexed-graph-for-each specifically, and without reintroducing per-query Triple allocation (see the paired \"Triple-valued leaves in TripleIndex\" decision from this same commit)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0149e858-86f0-48e8-8cee-bd5d7889cdf3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0149e858-86f0-48e8-8cee-bd5d7889cdf3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/115318b7-88ab-4895-83c3-b074fca4e09f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0149e858-86f0-48e8-8cee-bd5d7889cdf3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-05T18:00:36Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0149e858-86f0-48e8-8cee-bd5d7889cdf3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "indexed-graph-for-each diverges from indexed-graph-match's linear scan" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0149e858-86f0-48e8-8cee-bd5d7889cdf3> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#supersedes> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/b12354f4-127d-41bb-ab96-05888d2d11ff> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/05075f15-da22-4f30-96f3-f33b9ee2dd0c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/05075f15-da22-4f30-96f3-f33b9ee2dd0c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "serialize-ttl-stream duplicates serialize-ttl-string's subject/predicate/object grouping logic (the same same-subject/same-predicate/different-subject punctuation-choice branching) as a second, separately-maintained implementation driving direct fwrite calls instead of string-concat, and bypasses the file module's file-write-line abstraction by talking to a raw FILE* handle via FFI." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/05075f15-da22-4f30-96f3-f33b9ee2dd0c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
