<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/081378ce-dbc5-405b-acee-ba03d72b1235> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/081378ce-dbc5-405b-acee-ba03d72b1235> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The non-streaming parse-ttl-string / parse-ttl-file produce the same Graph with fewer allocations (views as lookup keys, one allocation per prefixed name and per escaped literal)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/081378ce-dbc5-405b-acee-ba03d72b1235> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
