<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0b44004e-d6cb-4eb0-8a07-09d14d7fa901> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Term-valued leaves restore term-eq-based Set/Map membership" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
