<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0b44004e-d6cb-4eb0-8a07-09d14d7fa901> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Set/Map membership and hashing for the SPO/PSO/OSP index leaves now goes through a single term-eq per element again, since the leaf element type changed back from Triple to Term (per this commit's \"Term-valued leaves\" decision). This directly reverses the prior commit's coupling of index-leaf equality to triple-eq. Evidence: src/index.slop, commit 06821168e146300f6a7a440650ff8d0bf5aa7b44." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0b44004e-d6cb-4eb0-8a07-09d14d7fa901> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
