<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/539eefe8-f1cf-4187-bf51-ab70ffafc005> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "indexed-graph-contains, indexed-graph-subjects, and indexed-graph-objects are rewritten again, this time back around direct bare-Term set membership/extraction instead of whole-Triple set membership/extraction — undoing the coupling to TripleSet that the prior \"Triple-valued leaves\" commit introduced. Evidence: src/index.slop diff, commit 06821168e146300f6a7a440650ff8d0bf5aa7b44." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
