<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/58f5a3de-16bf-48b7-8414-79a85cae9d27> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The TTL parser can now append duplicate triples read verbatim from a source document: graph-add-unchecked's own @post only guarantees size grows by exactly 1 per call, not that graph-contains holds afterward, unlike graph-add's — parsed graphs may contain duplicate triples that graph-add would have deduplicated." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
