<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/6393769e-e94e-4355-8c99-49ad932a82df> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "skip-whitespace/skip-line/parse-while/parse-until no longer route through state-advance for their internal iteration, so line/column-tracking logic is now duplicated between state-advance (still used for single-step advancement elsewhere) and each hot-loop function's own inline scalar tracking, instead of being centralized in one place." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
