<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/6393769e-e94e-4355-8c99-49ad932a82df> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "skip-whitespace/skip-line/parse-while/parse-until no longer route through state-advance for their internal iteration, so line/column-tracking logic is now duplicated between state-advance (still used for single-step advancement elsewhere) and each hot-loop function's own inline scalar tracking, instead of being centralized in one place." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/717658b4-4e59-4409-a610-f71331a57b32> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/717658b4-4e59-4409-a610-f71331a57b32> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "indexed-graph-match regains index-assisted lookup" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/717658b4-4e59-4409-a610-f71331a57b32> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/717658b4-4e59-4409-a610-f71331a57b32> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "indexed-graph-match is index-dispatched again: a query with subject and/or predicate and/or object bound now walks only the relevant SPO/PSO/OSP index leaf(s) rather than scanning every triple in g.triples, so its cost scales with the matching index partition rather than unconditionally with the whole graph — only the fully-unbound case still falls back to iterating g.triples. Evidence: src/index.slop, indexed-graph-match's nested match dispatch through `(. (. g index) spo)`/`pso`/`osp` introduced in commit 35d7d249, under the new comment \"Use index-based dispatch for O(1) lookup instead of full scan\", superseding the O(n)-regardless-of-binding behavior from the prior linear-scan decision." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/717658b4-4e59-4409-a610-f71331a57b32> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/717658b4-4e59-4409-a610-f71331a57b32> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/ce8986a6-39f9-4f56-b671-ed8ef4e4680c> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/717658b4-4e59-4409-a610-f71331a57b32> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-06T18:30:48Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/717658b4-4e59-4409-a610-f71331a57b32> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "indexed-graph-match regains index-assisted lookup" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/717658b4-4e59-4409-a610-f71331a57b32> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#supersedes> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/f8712f81-d7b1-471d-a01e-68d2ff922604> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7331534f-ff1e-4adc-b71a-a13047603c78> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
