<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7331534f-ff1e-4adc-b71a-a13047603c78> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Serializing a triple term now performs six arena allocations instead of one; acceptable because RDF 1.2 triple terms are rare relative to plain triples, but a hot-path caller would want string-build back once the verifier models it." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7353d1fc-af26-44f2-875f-44c37d14bf6c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7353d1fc-af26-44f2-875f-44c37d14bf6c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fully-unbound indexed-graph-match queries (subject/predicate/object all none) still fall back to a full linear scan of triples, since no index can do better when nothing constrains the pattern" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
