<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7353d1fc-af26-44f2-875f-44c37d14bf6c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Fully-unbound indexed-graph-match queries (subject/predicate/object all none) still fall back to a full linear scan of triples, since no index can do better when nothing constrains the pattern" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7386f8a7-a4f0-4c99-868b-2432454f0161> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7386f8a7-a4f0-4c99-868b-2432454f0161> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Values typed with any Tier 3/4 or unrecognized datatype IRI (dates, times, durations, hex/base64 binary, anyURI, language, Name/NCName/NMTOKEN, gYear/gMonth/gDay, duration types, etc.) always validate as true regardless of whether their lexical form is actually well-formed — xsd-validate-lexical only catches malformed lexical forms for the numeric/boolean/string types it explicitly handles in tiers 1-2" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7386f8a7-a4f0-4c99-868b-2432454f0161> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7386f8a7-a4f0-4c99-868b-2432454f0161> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7386f8a7-a4f0-4c99-868b-2432454f0161> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-08T17:16:35Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7386f8a7-a4f0-4c99-868b-2432454f0161> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Values typed with any Tier 3/4 or unrecognized datatype IRI (dates, times, durations, hex/base64 binary, anyURI, language, Name/NCName/NMTOKEN, gYear/gMonth/gDay, duration types, etc.) always validate as true regardless of whether their lexical form is actually well-formed — xsd-validate-lexical only catches malformed lexical forms for the numeric/boolean/string types it explicitly handles in tiers 1-2" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7ebca832-f69a-4d79-bbe3-223bbfba7967> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7ebca832-f69a-4d79-bbe3-223bbfba7967> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "indexed-graph-add and term-eq no longer have runtime-checked postconditions asserting these two specific properties; a future regression in either function that violates them would not be caught by contract verification." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7ebca832-f69a-4d79-bbe3-223bbfba7967> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7ebca832-f69a-4d79-bbe3-223bbfba7967> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7ebca832-f69a-4d79-bbe3-223bbfba7967> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-05T18:00:36Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/7ebca832-f69a-4d79-bbe3-223bbfba7967> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "indexed-graph-add and term-eq no longer have runtime-checked postconditions asserting these two specific properties; a future regression in either function that violates them would not be caught by contract verification." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/82e03c9a-b86f-4ac9-8af7-8b11560afb8c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/82e03c9a-b86f-4ac9-8af7-8b11560afb8c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Each `{| ... |}` annotation block mints its own independent blank-node reifier — annotating the same base triple with two separate blocks produces two distinct blank nodes, each related via rdf:reifies to an equal but separately-allocated triple-term, rather than being merged onto one shared reifier." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/82e03c9a-b86f-4ac9-8af7-8b11560afb8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/82e03c9a-b86f-4ac9-8af7-8b11560afb8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/82e03c9a-b86f-4ac9-8af7-8b11560afb8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-25T20:02:50Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/82e03c9a-b86f-4ac9-8af7-8b11560afb8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Each `{| ... |}` annotation block mints its own independent blank-node reifier — annotating the same base triple with two separate blocks produces two distinct blank nodes, each related via rdf:reifies to an equal but separately-allocated triple-term, rather than being merged onto one shared reifier." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/86be527c-91bc-4e92-9452-08e1e4a3b5ed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/86be527c-91bc-4e92-9452-08e1e4a3b5ed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Set/Map membership and hashing for the index leaves now goes through triple-eq (subject+predicate+object term-eq) instead of a single term-eq per element, since the leaf element type changed from Term to Triple." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/86be527c-91bc-4e92-9452-08e1e4a3b5ed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
