<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/86be527c-91bc-4e92-9452-08e1e4a3b5ed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-02-05T18:00:36Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/86be527c-91bc-4e92-9452-08e1e4a3b5ed> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Set/Map membership and hashing for the index leaves now goes through triple-eq (subject+predicate+object term-eq) instead of a single term-eq per element, since the leaf element type changed from Term to Triple." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95d50898-dcef-4d03-9e67-5af2446c74a4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95d50898-dcef-4d03-9e67-5af2446c74a4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "match/for-each reintroduce per-query Triple allocation via record-new" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95d50898-dcef-4d03-9e67-5af2446c74a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95d50898-dcef-4d03-9e67-5af2446c74a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "indexed-graph-match and indexed-graph-for-each no longer return/deliver the same Triple reference stored in g.triples; every matching leaf hit now allocates a fresh Triple via `(record-new Triple (subject s) (predicate p) (object o))`, trading the zero-allocation property away in exchange for the leaf-memory savings of this commit's \"Term-valued leaves\" decision. Evidence: src/index.slop diff, commit 06821168e146300f6a7a440650ff8d0bf5aa7b44 (\"memory usage improvements for IndexedGraph\")." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95d50898-dcef-4d03-9e67-5af2446c74a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95d50898-dcef-4d03-9e67-5af2446c74a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/e891e3bb-1db8-4f38-9247-5798562cddf8> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95d50898-dcef-4d03-9e67-5af2446c74a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-04-13T13:58:16Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95d50898-dcef-4d03-9e67-5af2446c74a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "match/for-each reintroduce per-query Triple allocation via record-new" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95d50898-dcef-4d03-9e67-5af2446c74a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsFrom> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/8f7b36d6-b754-4f7e-b1f0-196c92945ea2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/95d50898-dcef-4d03-9e67-5af2446c74a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#supersedes> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/374dd83f-66f2-4f47-aad6-26e8ba1ab155> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/a1d22b58-6544-4735-9bb3-c1d6f55cdb1c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/a1d22b58-6544-4735-9bb3-c1d6f55cdb1c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Each level of the SPO/PSO/OSP index update in indexed-graph-add now performs a single map-get dispatched via match instead of a map-has probe plus a conditional map-put plus an unconditional map-get, reducing map operations per index level on every triple insert." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/a1d22b58-6544-4735-9bb3-c1d6f55cdb1c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
