<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/b12354f4-127d-41bb-ab96-05888d2d11ff> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "The per-field matching filter logic (subject/predicate/object equality checks via term-eq) is now duplicated verbatim between indexed-graph-match and indexed-graph-for-each rather than factored into a shared helper, since both were introduced/changed in this same commit as separate for-each loops over g.triples." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c717ed95-96b8-4144-a9cb-e889b0a87ead> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c717ed95-96b8-4144-a9cb-e889b0a87ead> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "indexed-graph-contains, indexed-graph-subjects, and indexed-graph-objects all had to be rewritten around whole-Triple set membership/extraction instead of bare-Term set operations, coupling three previously-simpler functions to the new TripleSet representation." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/c717ed95-96b8-4144-a9cb-e889b0a87ead> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
