<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/cdbb0ab2-9a38-41b7-bf49-c55257b41596> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/cdbb0ab2-9a38-41b7-bf49-c55257b41596> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The old List-returning parse-predicate-object-list/parse-object-list and graph-add-all remain in use for RDF 1.2 annotation-block extra-triples inside the new *-into-graph functions themselves, so two parallel triple-accumulation strategies (list-then-merge vs. direct graph-threading) now coexist in the same file rather than one being fully retired." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/cdbb0ab2-9a38-41b7-bf49-c55257b41596> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/cdbb0ab2-9a38-41b7-bf49-c55257b41596> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/cdbb0ab2-9a38-41b7-bf49-c55257b41596> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-29T00:06:21Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/cdbb0ab2-9a38-41b7-bf49-c55257b41596> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "The old List-returning parse-predicate-object-list/parse-object-list and graph-add-all remain in use for RDF 1.2 annotation-block extra-triples inside the new *-into-graph functions themselves, so two parallel triple-accumulation strategies (list-then-merge vs. direct graph-threading) now coexist in the same file rather than one being fully retired." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d0d876e5-a4d9-42a5-81bd-ec743e65f34b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d0d876e5-a4d9-42a5-81bd-ec743e65f34b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Inherits the same silent-truncation-on-missing-rdf:rest behavior already documented for rdf-list-elements (see Lesson \"RDF list traversal truncates silently on malformed rest\", https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/509a6a33-ecec-448e-b4b6-773c2be46b54): when indexed-graph-match finds zero rdf:rest matches for the current node, the loop sets current to nil-term and stops instead of signaling an error, so a malformed IndexedGraph-backed list is indistinguishable from a well-formed short one." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d0d876e5-a4d9-42a5-81bd-ec743e65f34b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d0d876e5-a4d9-42a5-81bd-ec743e65f34b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d0d876e5-a4d9-42a5-81bd-ec743e65f34b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-01-24T17:26:24Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d0d876e5-a4d9-42a5-81bd-ec743e65f34b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Inherits the same silent-truncation-on-missing-rdf:rest behavior already documented for rdf-list-elements (see Lesson \"RDF list traversal truncates silently on malformed rest\", https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/509a6a33-ecec-448e-b4b6-773c2be46b54): when indexed-graph-match finds zero rdf:rest matches for the current node, the loop sets current to nil-term and stops instead of signaling an error, so a malformed IndexedGraph-backed list is indistinguishable from a well-formed short one." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d3147206-e929-4813-bfda-6805d229aa0e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d3147206-e929-4813-bfda-6805d229aa0e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A Triple passed to a streaming callback is valid only during that call (recorded as a Constraint)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
