<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/eac949da-b306-4484-ac9e-8754449cd37c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Introduces two near-duplicate parsing functions (parse-iri-ref-string/parse-prefixed-name-string) paralleling the existing parse-iri-ref/parse-prefixed-name, trading code duplication for eliminating a Term allocation-then-match round trip in literal-datatype parsing, a hot path when parsing typed/numeric literals." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
