<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/eac949da-b306-4484-ac9e-8754449cd37c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-29T14:07:04Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
