<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/f40405f6-c310-4afd-a6f7-32547e566690> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/f40405f6-c310-4afd-a6f7-32547e566690> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TtlParseContext's new `blank-labels` field had to be threaded through essentially every `record-new TtlParseContext` call site across ttl.slop and n3.slop (~20 call sites touched in this commit), extending the per-field record-new duplication already noted as a consequence of the 'Immutable ParseState threading' pattern (no record-update/spread syntax in Slop)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/f40405f6-c310-4afd-a6f7-32547e566690> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James Adam <jcadam@startmail.com>" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/f40405f6-c310-4afd-a6f7-32547e566690> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
